# Caddyfile MEDCOEL
# Pasang: sudo cp deploy/Caddyfile /etc/caddy/Caddyfile && sudo systemctl reload caddy
# Caddy mengurus HTTPS otomatis selama A record medcoel.com mengarah ke IP VPS.

www.medcoel.com {
	redir https://medcoel.com{uri} permanent
}

medcoel.com {
	encode gzip

	# Batas ukuran body. File PDF tidak lewat server (langsung ke Google
	# Drive), jadi cukup untuk JSON impor soal dan mode unggah lokal.
	request_body {
		max_size 60MB
	}

	header {
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains"
		X-Content-Type-Options nosniff
		Referrer-Policy strict-origin-when-cross-origin
		X-Frame-Options DENY
	}

	handle /api/* {
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8090
	}

	# Dashboard PocketBase (superuser). Boleh dibatasi IP bila perlu.
	handle /_/* {
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8090
	}

	# Persistent Anatomy mount; normal web builds cannot delete it.
	handle /anatomy/viewer {
	    redir * /anatomy/viewer/ 308
	}
	handle_path /anatomy/viewer/* {
	    # This directory/symlink lives OUTSIDE Vite's apps/web/dist.
	    root * /var/lib/medcoel/anatomy-viewer
	    header X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN
	    header Content-Security-Policy "frame-ancestors 'self'"
	    header Cache-Control "no-cache, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
	    @anatomy_hashed {
	        path /assets/*
	        file
	    }
	    header @anatomy_hashed >Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
	    @anatomy_binary {
	        path /models/* /draco/* /thumbnails/*
	        file
	    }
	    # These names are stable (thumbnail hashes identify structure IDs, not bytes).
	    header @anatomy_binary >Cache-Control "public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate"
	    @anatomy_glb path *.glb
	    header @anatomy_glb Content-Type model/gltf-binary
	    @anatomy_wasm path *.wasm
	    header @anatomy_wasm Content-Type application/wasm
	    # No SPA fallback here: missing model/JS/Draco is always 404.
	    file_server
	}
	
	handle {
		root * /opt/medcoel/apps/web/dist
		@assets path /assets/*
		header @assets Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
		try_files {path} /index.html
		file_server
	}
}
